nter\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4564870\/extras\/c7e9d662162d0b4e664c23bb88f872b0.poster.avif?t=1793706574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4564870\/extras\/c7e9d662162d0b4e664c23bb88f872b0.webm?t=1793706574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4564870\/extras\/c7e9d662162d0b4e664c23bb88f872b0.mp4?t=1793706574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing idle simulation about ant colonies on your desktop, hatch and expand your ant army from zero. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your ants with special functional food, and dye them bright, diverse colors with pigmented liquid. Play tricks on ants with props like stones, bottle caps and fireworks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ants will forage and wander freely on screen with vivid little behaviors. Colony vs colony battles over resources will arrive in future updates for more competitive fun.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A relaxing casual idle game made for all insect lovers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4564870\/extras\/c0011e7652ecdce574688d460e1ece73.avif?t=1793706574\" width=889 height=108 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4564870\/extras\/3b6b9174c6685c5ad66ad72b93924b95.poster.avif?t=1793706574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/ste